WEBVTT

00:00:05.690 --> 00:00:07.930
Hello!

00:00:07.930 --> 00:00:08.730
Huh?

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:12.240
No one's here?

00:00:12.730 --> 00:00:14.400
Damn it, you're so noisy.

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:16.170
You woke me up.

00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:19.310
Sorry, I might be here too early,

00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:21.370
especially with Arisu-chan on cleaning duty.

00:00:21.370 --> 00:00:22.250
Hello.

00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:23.500
Yes?

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:25.640
Numazon delivery.

00:00:29.450 --> 00:00:31.230
Wh-What...

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:37.260
Thank you.

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:45.520
Help!

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:48.020
Ready...

00:02:17.990 --> 00:02:19.990
<b>Student Council Room</b>

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:23.490
Anime Club...

00:02:23.740 --> 00:02:25.300
I won't give up.

00:02:25.300 --> 00:02:27.760
I'll shut down your club.

00:02:27.760 --> 00:02:28.530
And...

00:02:30.240 --> 00:02:31.250
Chairperson.

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:35.530
We've returned. As instructed,
we've researched the club's expenditures,

00:02:35.530 --> 00:02:38.260
the members' friendships, 
their favorite anime...

00:02:38.750 --> 00:02:42.510
Everything there is to 
know about the Anime Club...

00:02:42.780 --> 00:02:43.650
I see.

00:02:44.250 --> 00:02:46.450
I don't care how insignificant it may seem.

00:02:46.940 --> 00:02:48.660
Find any and every issue you can.

00:02:48.660 --> 00:02:49.520
Yes.

00:02:51.910 --> 00:02:54.020
That was a close one.

00:02:54.520 --> 00:02:57.890
You could have helped me, 
rather than just saving yourself.

00:02:57.890 --> 00:02:58.780
You okay?

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:01.410
Nakano-senpai.

00:03:03.890 --> 00:03:05.160
Thank you.

00:03:05.370 --> 00:03:07.410
I'm glad for you, my little kitten.

00:03:09.900 --> 00:03:12.180
What do you think these boxes are?

00:03:12.180 --> 00:03:13.170
Oh.

00:03:13.530 --> 00:03:15.170
It looks like they've arrived.

00:03:15.170 --> 00:03:15.670
<b>Sorame Yujincho
5</b>

00:03:15.170 --> 00:03:15.670
<b>Fight! Onotokisaka Academy
Idol Club!</b>

00:03:15.670 --> 00:03:16.170
<b>PreFae Supers</b>

00:03:15.670 --> 00:03:16.170
<b>Replica</b>

00:03:17.020 --> 00:03:19.220
This is all anime?

00:03:20.900 --> 00:03:26.680
I ordered it all on Numazon so that we'd 
have a collection fit for the Anime Club.

00:03:27.080 --> 00:03:31.530
The special edition <i>Dub Tone</i> movie 
Blu-ray with limited-edition packaging.

00:03:31.530 --> 00:03:34.690
It has the uncut concert scene, too, right?

00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:36.660
Oh?

00:03:36.660 --> 00:03:38.960
The <i>Chaos Mad Nova</i> box set.

00:03:39.350 --> 00:03:42.810
The fan disc has the unthinkable, younger 
sister story, too, if I'm not mistaken.

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:46.410
You even got the latest volume of <i>Anosuba</i>.

00:03:47.730 --> 00:03:52.050
I can watch the useless goddess Aquina's 
barfing scenes over and over in the club room!

00:03:53.280 --> 00:03:55.580
We've got a nice set of saucers?

00:03:56.160 --> 00:03:57.310
Saucers?

00:03:57.310 --> 00:03:58.720
Not <i>those</i> saucers.

00:03:58.720 --> 00:04:02.410
It's what we call physical anime discs.

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:09.190
Disc sales can make or 
break a late-night anime.

00:04:09.190 --> 00:04:11.230
It's a critical matter.

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:25.860
Wonderland Heart

00:04:11.670 --> 00:04:18.650
They come with concert raffle tickets 
and event invitations and such.

00:04:15.060 --> 00:04:25.950
Concerts    Events    Fan-Meets

00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:21.390
The bonus material gets better every year.

00:04:21.390 --> 00:04:24.580
They even come with figures or concept art.

00:04:24.580 --> 00:04:27.740
Sometimes, you can't even 
tell what's the main product.

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:27.740
Blu-ray Volume 1 Includes Figure

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:27.740
<b>Actual video</b>

00:04:28.050 --> 00:04:32.110
People would talk about how 
the artwork is a disaster,

00:04:32.110 --> 00:04:37.320
but the artists would spend sleepless nights,

00:04:37.320 --> 00:04:40.500
working their butts off to 
turn it into something divine.

00:04:40.850 --> 00:04:44.080
Once you're a master, like I am, 
you'll have a copy for storage,

00:04:44.080 --> 00:04:45.100
for decorating,

00:04:45.100 --> 00:04:45.710
for evangelism,

00:04:45.710 --> 00:04:46.640
for watching,

00:04:46.640 --> 00:04:48.030
for backup,

00:04:48.030 --> 00:04:50.010
along with all the store-specific exclusives.

00:04:50.240 --> 00:04:53.330
I don't hesitate to buy multiple copies.

00:04:53.330 --> 00:04:54.640
Sure, sure.

00:04:54.880 --> 00:04:59.100
Thus, no matter how much funding I 
have, it all vanishes into the discs.

00:04:59.100 --> 00:05:01.960
The time has come for me to tap 
into my Swiss bank account.

00:05:01.960 --> 00:05:05.400
Why are they so desperate to sell discs?

00:05:06.130 --> 00:05:07.930
Good question.

00:05:07.930 --> 00:05:12.460
Airing anime doesn't actually make money.

00:05:12.460 --> 00:05:15.880
Making anime costs a lot of money.

00:05:15.880 --> 00:05:19.160
So multiple companies 
invest in a single show,

00:05:19.160 --> 00:05:22.460
and create an organization called 
a "production committee."

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:23.420
Committee?

00:05:23.750 --> 00:05:26.870
Production committees come up 
with budgets for the anime,

00:05:26.870 --> 00:05:31.970
and distribute revenue from 
the discs and merchandise,

00:05:31.970 --> 00:05:34.680
as well as from online streaming 
and overseas distribution.

00:05:34.680 --> 00:05:38.940
Anime Shangri-La

00:05:34.680 --> 00:05:38.940
<b>God's Love on This
Wonderful Blessing!</b>

00:05:34.680 --> 00:05:38.940
Anime Season 2
Announced!!

00:05:34.860 --> 00:05:38.940
If the sales figures are good, 
sometimes they'll even get a second season.

00:05:39.160 --> 00:05:42.150
At times, they'd work 
to hype it up, at times,

00:05:42.150 --> 00:05:44.940
they'd change the content of the 
anime for the sake of business.

00:05:45.400 --> 00:05:49.430
They're kind of like a 
powerful shadow organization

00:05:49.430 --> 00:05:53.450
that has immeasurable influence 
over the production.

00:05:54.590 --> 00:05:56.400
I never knew.

00:05:56.400 --> 00:05:59.020
You see it on the screen 
in school anime a lot.

00:05:59.020 --> 00:06:02.730
For example, <i>Sakaneko Academy 
Private School Student Council</i>.

00:06:02.730 --> 00:06:03.550
So then,

00:06:03.940 --> 00:06:08.910
the student council is a shadow 
organization that controls the school?

00:06:08.910 --> 00:06:12.210
Minoa, are you sure you haven't 
been watching too much anime?

00:06:12.210 --> 00:06:15.560
Although she's probably right in that 
you'd be in trouble if you opposed them.

00:06:15.800 --> 00:06:19.460
Hey, did you buy all these discs?

00:06:19.460 --> 00:06:20.060
Well,

00:06:20.510 --> 00:06:22.960
what belongs to the Anime Club belongs to me.

00:06:22.960 --> 00:06:25.320
What belongs to me belongs to me.

00:06:27.550 --> 00:06:29.850
Wait, so, what?

00:06:31.090 --> 00:06:34.450
We've finally got you, Anime Club!

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:36.780
It's them!

00:06:36.780 --> 00:06:37.960
The production committee!

00:06:38.260 --> 00:06:39.140
What?

00:06:39.140 --> 00:06:41.150
Nothing, we were talking 
about something else.

00:06:41.150 --> 00:06:42.210
So what do you want?

00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:44.340
What's got you so eager?

00:06:44.940 --> 00:06:48.180
This is the receipt for club spending.

00:06:48.180 --> 00:06:50.980
What is "Anime software costs"?

00:06:52.170 --> 00:06:56.070
You didn't buy that using 
club funding, did you?

00:06:53.600 --> 00:06:57.730
<b>God's Love on This
Wonderful Blessing!</b>

00:06:56.070 --> 00:06:57.730
Don't bother trying to hide it.

00:06:58.060 --> 00:07:00.050
The jig is up.

00:07:00.050 --> 00:07:01.880
The criminal is among us!

00:07:03.230 --> 00:07:04.590
You're correct.

00:07:05.200 --> 00:07:08.740
Wait, why are you so quick to confess?

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:10.900
Give me a chance to show off 
my Vice President skills!

00:07:11.210 --> 00:07:13.490
This is where the treasurer gets to show off.

00:07:14.190 --> 00:07:17.410
A total cost of 341,951 yen.

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:19.910
To think you wasted club 
funding on such a thing.

00:07:20.190 --> 00:07:23.370
With all due respect, the club 
funding belongs to the club members.

00:07:23.370 --> 00:07:25.190
That is, it belongs to me.

00:07:25.190 --> 00:07:28.590
What's wrong with using 
my own money for myself?

00:07:28.590 --> 00:07:30.300
<i>That's</i> what you meant?!

00:07:30.890 --> 00:07:32.090
In any case,

00:07:32.290 --> 00:07:37.520
a newly-founded Anime Club won't be allowed 
to spend such a large amount of money.

00:07:37.910 --> 00:07:40.060
Then I'll use my pocket money.

00:07:40.350 --> 00:07:41.140
Sebas.

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:43.310
Wait a minute, Arisucchi.

00:07:44.120 --> 00:07:48.340
As the president, it's my fault that I 
failed to adequately manage the members.

00:07:48.340 --> 00:07:53.090
Besides, this is the kind of thing 
that we need to solve for ourselves.

00:07:53.770 --> 00:07:55.320
Then how about this:

00:07:55.800 --> 00:07:59.670
For the next week, you'll assist the 
other clubs without compensation.

00:07:59.670 --> 00:08:02.180
Unless the student council 
approves of the work you do,

00:08:02.180 --> 00:08:04.310
the Anime Club will be abolished.

00:08:04.310 --> 00:08:05.830
Th-That's too...

00:08:06.400 --> 00:08:07.950
Of course you can't.

00:08:07.950 --> 00:08:11.090
The Anime Club isn't good for anything.

00:08:11.400 --> 00:08:12.660
It can't create anything.

00:08:12.660 --> 00:08:14.360
It's just baggage.

00:08:14.360 --> 00:08:17.920
There's no way you can do anything 
of merit for the other clubs.

00:08:19.300 --> 00:08:23.000
You'll have to prove otherwise, 
if that bothers you.

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:24.060
That I'm wrong.

00:08:24.340 --> 00:08:25.650
It'll be interesting.

00:08:34.210 --> 00:08:37.550
We <i>just</i> survived getting shut down.

00:08:37.550 --> 00:08:38.490
Here you go.

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:40.740
Nakano-senpai.

00:08:41.650 --> 00:08:43.210
Thank you.

00:08:43.640 --> 00:08:46.130
I never knew we were at the same station.

00:08:46.490 --> 00:08:49.320
A heavy-handed student council 
threatening to shut down a club.

00:08:49.320 --> 00:08:51.370
It's a club anime classic.

00:08:51.370 --> 00:08:52.400
I know, right?

00:08:52.400 --> 00:08:54.660
I saw something like that on a TV drama.

00:08:54.660 --> 00:08:56.400
Yeah, I mean in an anime.

00:08:56.400 --> 00:08:57.980
Oh. Okay.

00:08:58.760 --> 00:09:02.640
So why did you join the Anime Club?

00:09:02.910 --> 00:09:04.370
Well...

00:09:04.370 --> 00:09:09.150
I think I've always aspired to be 
in a club with like-minded people.

00:09:09.830 --> 00:09:14.150
The moment we come together 
and grow as a group

00:09:14.730 --> 00:09:17.420
is quite spectacular, don't you think?

00:09:17.420 --> 00:09:21.660
Just like that Onotokisaka Academy Idol Club.

00:09:21.910 --> 00:09:23.570
Onotokisaka?

00:09:23.570 --> 00:09:26.420
It's a legendary high school idol club.

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:29.390
They overcame the student 
council's sabotaging,

00:09:29.390 --> 00:09:31.420
and saved the club from being abolished.

00:09:31.610 --> 00:09:34.220
And those are high schoolers?

00:09:34.220 --> 00:09:35.170
That's amazing.

00:09:35.730 --> 00:09:38.540
We have to do what we can, too, then.

00:09:39.680 --> 00:09:41.560
Yeah, it was an anime, though.

00:09:40.030 --> 00:09:41.560
Let's do this!

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:52.940
Anime Club!

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:55.440
We'd like to support your clubs!

00:09:55.910 --> 00:10:00.200
We'll help with anything!

00:10:00.520 --> 00:10:01.830
Erika-senpai?!

00:10:02.040 --> 00:10:03.840
Morning, Minoacchi.

00:10:03.840 --> 00:10:06.080
What's up with the outfit?

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:07.750
We'll Help Your Clubs!
Contact us
Anime Club
Club Building 3F

00:10:06.360 --> 00:10:09.510
You could say it's my expression of intent.

00:10:09.510 --> 00:10:11.560
Although it was a bit tight.

00:10:11.560 --> 00:10:13.210
I'll help.

00:10:15.590 --> 00:10:16.720
Please and thank you.

00:10:17.720 --> 00:10:18.930
Anime Club.

00:10:18.930 --> 00:10:20.720
I'll help.

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:24.720
Arisucchi...

00:10:26.340 --> 00:10:29.230
I won't sleep well, seeing the club die.

00:10:29.650 --> 00:10:31.770
We have to do what we can.

00:10:31.770 --> 00:10:34.390
Handing out fliers is what it's all about.

00:10:36.400 --> 00:10:39.240
I'll neither run nor hide.

00:10:39.760 --> 00:10:41.880
All pitches, straight down the middle!

00:10:50.910 --> 00:10:52.330
That's a game!

00:10:57.080 --> 00:10:58.590
Hello, everyone—

00:11:02.410 --> 00:11:03.840
I don't understand you.

00:11:05.220 --> 00:11:06.470
I feel it...

00:11:06.810 --> 00:11:09.730
The dough is cooking inside 
the electron purgatory.

00:11:09.980 --> 00:11:14.550
My magnificent gadget makes 
quick work of <i>any</i> confectionery!

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:22.360
Show me, Miko, your most godly move.

00:11:28.410 --> 00:11:29.620
It's no use!

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:33.280
We've screwed up at every club we've helped.

00:11:33.280 --> 00:11:35.740
Where's Gomon-sensei when you need him?

00:11:35.740 --> 00:11:37.780
He's on business abroad this week.

00:11:37.780 --> 00:11:39.190
To China, apparently.

00:11:39.190 --> 00:11:41.380
What terrible timing.

00:11:41.830 --> 00:11:43.780
We only have two more days.

00:11:45.130 --> 00:11:48.390
We're really going to end up being shut down.

00:11:48.680 --> 00:11:50.640
This was originally your fault, Arisu.

00:11:51.160 --> 00:11:55.440
This calls for me to acquire this academy 
and take over the student council.

00:11:55.440 --> 00:11:59.150
Your thoughts are possessed by the devil.

00:11:59.330 --> 00:12:00.400
It appears so.

00:12:00.570 --> 00:12:02.660
Wh-What?!

00:12:04.020 --> 00:12:05.270
G-Guys...

00:12:05.270 --> 00:12:06.340
Stop.

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:10.160
This isn't the time to 
be fighting with each other.

00:12:13.600 --> 00:12:14.670
Here we go.

00:12:15.140 --> 00:12:17.130
It's a request from the Drama Club.

00:12:18.280 --> 00:12:21.800
They're performing a musical at school for 
the new students the day after tomorrow.

00:12:21.800 --> 00:12:27.050
<b>Sakaneko High School
Drama Club</b>

00:12:21.800 --> 00:12:27.050
<b>Musical</b>

00:12:21.800 --> 00:12:27.050
<b>New Students Welcome!!</b>

00:12:22.150 --> 00:12:26.020
Apparently they didn't get the costumes 
they ordered, and they're in a bind.

00:12:26.020 --> 00:12:27.050
Costumes?

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:30.490
You could make some, couldn't you, Senpai?

00:12:31.030 --> 00:12:32.710
I-I guess.

00:12:33.080 --> 00:12:36.060
I'll do what I can.

00:12:36.060 --> 00:12:38.570
<b>Student Council Room</b>

00:12:37.070 --> 00:12:38.570
End of report, ma'am.

00:12:38.910 --> 00:12:41.680
The Anime Club is making 
costumes for the Drama Club?

00:12:43.030 --> 00:12:44.200
They're wasting their time.

00:12:48.950 --> 00:12:53.960
<b>Club Room Go Boom!</b>

00:13:11.140 --> 00:13:12.090
Nope.

00:13:12.420 --> 00:13:13.900
I can't do it.

00:13:21.700 --> 00:13:23.280
Erika-senpai...

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:36.600
The Anime Club isn't good for anything.

00:13:36.600 --> 00:13:38.290
It can't create anything.

00:13:46.820 --> 00:13:48.240
I'm here from Japan.

00:13:48.240 --> 00:13:49.550
My name is Aoyama Erika.

00:13:50.040 --> 00:13:51.230
Um...

00:13:51.910 --> 00:13:52.880
So...

00:13:53.570 --> 00:13:55.620
Hey, want to come over to 
have pizza and watch TV?

00:13:55.170 --> 00:13:56.440
H-Hey...

00:13:55.620 --> 00:13:56.840
Do you have soft serve?

00:13:56.840 --> 00:13:57.810
Yes.

00:14:03.190 --> 00:14:05.190
<b>PreFae Supers</b>

00:14:05.660 --> 00:14:06.770
<i>PreFae</i>.

00:14:07.120 --> 00:14:09.070
I never knew it was airing here.

00:14:11.300 --> 00:14:12.700
Hey, Erika!

00:14:14.320 --> 00:14:16.190
This anime's from Japan, right?

00:14:16.190 --> 00:14:17.370
You know it?

00:14:17.860 --> 00:14:19.710
Yeah, of course.

00:14:20.200 --> 00:14:25.090
We're cosplayers, but what do they say 
in Japanese when they're transforming?

00:14:26.240 --> 00:14:27.090
She's saying...

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:36.020
Enemies of Mother Earth, 
cease your evil deeds!

00:14:45.720 --> 00:14:47.000
Erika-senpai.

00:14:49.440 --> 00:14:51.960
Senpai, I have an idea.

00:14:52.940 --> 00:14:57.240
Why don't you draw from the 
idol anime that I like.

00:14:57.240 --> 00:14:58.660
Idol anime?

00:14:58.980 --> 00:14:59.840
Yes.

00:14:59.840 --> 00:15:02.670
It was in the stack of discs 
that Arisu-chan bought us.

00:15:04.480 --> 00:15:06.460
<i>I want to make the world's best costume!</i>

00:15:07.100 --> 00:15:08.530
<i>Shall we start with silkworms?</i>

00:15:08.530 --> 00:15:10.510
<i>We'll need mulberry fields, too!</i>

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:13.010
<i>Onotoki!</i>

00:15:13.250 --> 00:15:14.220
<i>Onotoki!</i>

00:15:14.310 --> 00:15:15.470
<i>Onotoki!</i>

00:15:15.840 --> 00:15:16.460
<i>Ono...</i>

00:15:16.460 --> 00:15:16.970
<i>...toki!</i>

00:15:16.970 --> 00:15:17.420
<i>Ono...</i>

00:15:17.420 --> 00:15:17.960
<i>...toki!</i>

00:15:17.960 --> 00:15:18.350
<i>Ono...</i>

00:15:18.350 --> 00:15:18.870
<i>...toki!</i>

00:15:18.870 --> 00:15:19.280
<i>Ono...</i>

00:15:19.280 --> 00:15:19.760
<i>...toki!</i>

00:15:19.760 --> 00:15:20.170
<i>Ono...</i>

00:15:20.170 --> 00:15:20.760
<i>...toki!</i>

00:15:22.460 --> 00:15:23.980
<i>We did it!</i>

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:27.990
Well?

00:15:28.460 --> 00:15:30.990
Don't you think these girls 
are absolutely dazzling?

00:15:31.840 --> 00:15:34.770
Idol anime comes in the 
standard school club stories,

00:15:32.160 --> 00:15:34.410
Idol Club Philosophy

00:15:34.410 --> 00:15:36.870
<b>14th Newcomer Audition</b>

00:15:34.770 --> 00:15:36.560
stories about the agency,

00:15:36.560 --> 00:15:38.290
regional idols...

00:15:38.290 --> 00:15:39.750
all kinds of genres.

00:15:40.390 --> 00:15:44.970
The girls depicted in 3D computer 
graphics and virtuosic artwork

00:15:44.970 --> 00:15:46.250
are absolutely adorable.

00:15:46.730 --> 00:15:48.210
Just watching them,

00:15:48.360 --> 00:15:51.330
you can almost smell their 
sweat and feel their breathing.

00:15:51.330 --> 00:15:54.720
It's just utterly amazing.

00:15:55.220 --> 00:15:56.360
The costumes, too.

00:15:56.360 --> 00:15:59.130
Elegant! Fabulous! Excellent!

00:15:59.130 --> 00:16:02.480
They accent the girls' beauty beyond words.

00:16:05.130 --> 00:16:06.480
I'm going to explode.

00:16:06.730 --> 00:16:10.740
Feature these, and I guarantee that 
you'll have the best costume ever.

00:16:10.930 --> 00:16:14.230
Idol anime always tell the 
story of an idol group

00:16:14.230 --> 00:16:18.960
that begins without cohesion, 
and comes together.

00:16:18.960 --> 00:16:21.990
<i>Beauty!</i>

00:16:22.860 --> 00:16:23.950
Is that...

00:16:23.950 --> 00:16:24.990
That's right.

00:16:24.990 --> 00:16:29.130
It's exactly where we are now.

00:16:29.720 --> 00:16:31.780
Let's do it, Erika-senpai.

00:16:32.150 --> 00:16:35.410
You're still our president, Erika-senpai.

00:16:35.410 --> 00:16:39.490
I want to continue this club 
with you and everyone else.

00:16:39.490 --> 00:16:40.640
Minoacchi...

00:16:41.060 --> 00:16:42.890
We do, too.

00:16:49.620 --> 00:16:50.580
Guys...

00:16:52.700 --> 00:16:54.150
We don't have time.

00:16:54.720 --> 00:16:56.680
Nakanocchi and I will design.

00:16:57.530 --> 00:17:00.380
Kaikai and Mikocchi, you two find cloth.

00:17:00.380 --> 00:17:03.040
Arisucchi and Minoacchi, 
you two do the tacking.

00:17:03.040 --> 00:17:04.660
Start immediately.

00:17:04.660 --> 00:17:05.420
Okay.

00:17:12.300 --> 00:17:13.550
<b>Wholesale Fabrics Center</b>

00:17:20.010 --> 00:17:21.020
It's fine.

00:17:21.020 --> 00:17:24.050
I need to make this with my own hands.

00:17:28.640 --> 00:17:30.820
Mii-chan, you're still up?

00:17:32.560 --> 00:17:34.610
Onee-chan...

00:17:34.610 --> 00:17:36.570
I'm almost done.

00:17:37.510 --> 00:17:40.760
You're really working hard 
in the Anime Club, huh?

00:17:46.430 --> 00:17:48.970
Hurry, the performance is about to start.

00:17:49.340 --> 00:17:50.210
Okay.

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:52.840
<b>New Student
Welcome Party</b>

00:17:57.660 --> 00:18:00.520
They're never going to get 
the costumes done in time.

00:18:00.520 --> 00:18:03.400
They may delay the event.

00:18:03.400 --> 00:18:08.090
No, I've told the Drama Club that they may 
not go over their allotted time in the gym.

00:18:08.090 --> 00:18:09.980
Their performance is over, then.

00:18:10.490 --> 00:18:11.680
Don't worry.

00:18:11.680 --> 00:18:14.040
It's showtime.

00:18:18.620 --> 00:18:20.900
<i>Three, two, one.</i>

00:18:33.420 --> 00:18:34.680
No way.

00:18:39.590 --> 00:18:42.140
We barely made it.

00:18:53.420 --> 00:18:54.470
We did it!

00:18:54.470 --> 00:18:56.070
We can convince the student council now.

00:18:56.070 --> 00:18:58.060
No, we don't approve.

00:18:59.400 --> 00:19:03.600
You're sorely mistaken if you think you've 
done enough to avoid getting shut down.

00:19:03.600 --> 00:19:05.710
That silly anime club of yours.

00:19:05.710 --> 00:19:07.410
It's not silly.

00:19:08.270 --> 00:19:12.220
Anime saved me when I was 
alone, studying abroad.

00:19:12.220 --> 00:19:15.130
So I'm not going to lose this Anime Club,

00:19:15.130 --> 00:19:18.550
this place for all of us to belong.

00:19:18.780 --> 00:19:21.850
It's not true that anime 
doesn't create anything.

00:19:21.850 --> 00:19:24.180
Anime creates a lot of things.

00:19:24.730 --> 00:19:27.970
Not just things, but bonds 
between person and person.

00:19:28.960 --> 00:19:32.940
Didn't it do that for us, too, Tsubaki?

00:19:37.660 --> 00:19:39.700
Tsubaki, it's time to transform!

00:19:41.190 --> 00:19:43.500
<i>PreFae</i> is two people.

00:19:43.500 --> 00:19:44.830
I need one more.

00:19:45.810 --> 00:19:47.100
Erika-chan...

00:19:51.840 --> 00:19:54.580
Enemies of Mother Earth...

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:57.720
...cease your evil deeds!

00:20:01.440 --> 00:20:04.250
You and I aren't the same anymore.

00:20:04.250 --> 00:20:05.620
I'm the student president.

00:20:05.620 --> 00:20:07.380
I can't let this slide.

00:20:08.560 --> 00:20:09.850
Raise the curtains.

00:20:19.640 --> 00:20:23.240
Our costumes today were put 
together by the Anime Club.

00:20:23.580 --> 00:20:27.890
It's thanks to them that our 
performance was a success.

00:20:28.580 --> 00:20:30.840
Please give a grand round of applause.

00:20:35.230 --> 00:20:37.050
Thanks for the help!

00:20:37.050 --> 00:20:39.010
We got more listeners thanks to you.

00:20:39.010 --> 00:20:41.260
We got our club room renovated!

00:20:42.440 --> 00:20:45.130
I hate to admit it, but you win this time.

00:20:45.130 --> 00:20:47.830
I'll take back abolishing the club.

00:20:47.830 --> 00:20:48.640
Tsubaki...

00:20:48.640 --> 00:20:50.460
But don't you forget.

00:20:50.460 --> 00:20:53.600
I'll never get to like what you like.

00:20:54.420 --> 00:20:56.100
Wait, President!

00:20:56.100 --> 00:20:58.810
How can you be so easy?!

00:20:59.220 --> 00:21:01.440
We did it, Erika-senpai.

00:21:02.220 --> 00:21:05.630
I'll be more careful about how 
I use club funding from now on.

00:21:05.630 --> 00:21:07.620
Thanks, guys.

00:21:08.680 --> 00:21:10.660
Erika-senpai!

00:21:11.120 --> 00:21:14.160
We're dazzling right now.

00:21:14.820 --> 00:21:17.170
You're all my beautiful little kittens.

00:21:17.170 --> 00:21:19.170
<b>Student Council Room</b>

00:21:18.210 --> 00:21:19.170
Yes.

00:21:19.520 --> 00:21:21.660
I failed to shut down the club.

00:21:21.660 --> 00:21:25.240
This situation is no longer under my control.

00:21:26.770 --> 00:21:27.890
Yes.

00:21:27.890 --> 00:21:29.180
Pardon me.

00:21:29.180 --> 00:21:30.100
President.

00:21:31.550 --> 00:21:33.230
Guess what they did this time!

00:21:35.190 --> 00:21:38.290
300,000 yen worth of cosplay costumes!

00:21:38.950 --> 00:21:40.930
I don't need any more reports.

00:21:42.180 --> 00:21:47.820
<i>It seems your resolve will 
be tested even more, Erika.</i>

00:23:22.660 --> 00:23:26.380
Anime, back in the day, had people
become idols with just a bit of magic.

00:23:26.380 --> 00:23:28.040
It was so filled with dreams!

00:23:28.040 --> 00:23:32.110
Idol anime these days have them 
legit practicing and auditioning.

00:23:32.110 --> 00:23:34.260
Tough times we live in.

00:23:34.260 --> 00:23:38.300
Next episode: "The Anime Club 
Gets a Spot Along the Wall!"

00:23:38.300 --> 00:23:40.290
Don't stay up all night.
